# This project has TWO separate .env files, one per app:
#
#   backend/.env   -> database connection, JWT secret, port
#   frontend/.env  -> (not required by default; the frontend talks to
#                      http://localhost:5000/api, hardcoded in
#                      frontend/src/services/api.ts)
#
# See backend/.env.example for the variables you need to fill in.
